From freebsd-alpha  Mon Apr 24 11:44:03 2000
From: Doug Rabson <dfr () nlsystems ! com>
Date: Mon, 24 Apr 2000 11:44:03 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: need help porting JDK2 to alpha
